{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50518","headline":"句 · 赵不爲","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"调弦敷广西惠，济物被深仁。\n（〖1〗句列光温古祈雨诗句後。\n曰「五𠥱〖月〗十〖乙〗〖日〗，前南岳斋郎赵不爲诗曰\n〖句不重录〗」望按：《全唐文》爲四○一有赵不爲文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵不爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}